{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/dc4b9aae3d6296eea5d5def6c508bf37.avif?t=1760380634\" width=943 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roach Post</strong> is a roguelike puzzle game where you use <strong>polyomino</strong>-shaped stamps to teleport packages, earning points through clever combinations of shapes, colors, and hardworking roach assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.mp4?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1c Welcome to Roach Post!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Polly</strong>, a magical mail carrier.<br>Together with your trusty sidekick \u2014 a cockroach named <strong>Mino</strong> \u2014 you\u2019ll teleport letters and packages using enchanted polyomino stamps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2709\ufe0f Place stamps \u2014 gain power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/176bb6c09d5f99d2513a3ed9956c65e5.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/176bb6c09d5f99d2513a3ed9956c65e5.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stamp you place on a package gives you <strong>power</strong>.<br>Earn enough power, and the package gets sent!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Color interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamps in <i>Roach Post</i> aren't just colorful \u2014 their hues <strong>interact</strong>:<br>some combinations <strong>boost</strong> your power, others <strong>weaken</strong> it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1e Roach Workers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/143eb9fefa8a80dd51517bba87acead5.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/143eb9fefa8a80dd51517bba87acead5.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to stamps, you can bring along <strong>roach workers</strong> \u2014<br>tiny helpers with big effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your favorite roaches, combine their abilities, and deliver every last package with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Build your deck of stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, you choose which stamps to bring on your shift. <br><strong>Craft your strategy</strong> by mixing shapes, colors, and special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1c Waiting for you at the Roach Post!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=528 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.mp4?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1760380634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514630?t=1760380634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/2ae0bec05c2f35300fcc0ac0f1eb37ef6d1f9a12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760380634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/2ae0bec05c2f35300fcc0ac0f1eb37ef6d1f9a12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760380634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3762590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/dc4b9aae3d6296eea5d5def6c508bf37.avif?t=1760380634\" width=943 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roach Post</strong> is a roguelike puzzle game where you use <strong>polyomino</strong>-shaped stamps to teleport packages, earning points through clever combinations of shapes, colors, and hardworking roach assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.webm?t=176038063