43eb9fefa8a80dd51517bba87acead5.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to stamps, you can bring along <strong>roach workers</strong> \u2014<br>tiny helpers with big effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your favorite roaches, combine their abilities, and deliver every last package with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Build your deck of stamps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, you choose which stamps to bring on your shift. <br><strong>Craft your strategy</strong> by mixing shapes, colors, and special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1c Waiting for you at the Roach Post!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.poster.avif?t=1760380634\" width=528 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.webm?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/cfdae7c4f1b545667d3d47ec2abeb666.mp4?t=1760380634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["KARP GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/522b27cda97039ac05f282f42db483122c6392c2/header.jpg?t=1760380634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514630/1036769991/fc06fdc51660830802e70fc0ae9216d44fd6379c/1759183044/dash_av1.mpd?t=175